Designing Databases

### Data Modeling
4 steps:
> Understanding the requirements
> Build a conceptual model
> Build a logical model
> Buid a physical model

### Conceptual model
2种方式：
> Entity Relationships(ER)
> UML（Unified Modeling Languages, 标准建模语言图）

Tools:
> Microsoft visio
> draw.io
> Lucid.charts

包含的信息：entity, atrributes, relationships

### Logical models
在 conceptual models 的基础上，
（1）增加 data types 信息。
（2）尽可能细分 attributes，比如姓名，拆分为姓和名。

Relationships 类别
(1) one to one
(2) one to many
(3) many to many


### Physical models
Primary keys
Foreign keys(parent--child, key--foreign)
只有当设置表格的 primary keys 时，表格关系才能设置。

## Foreign keys constraints
当主键值变化（update 或 delete）时，需要确认对应的 foreign keys值如何变化（CASCADE/RESTRICT/NO ACTION/SET NULL)

## Normalization 
7条规范（可以只关注前 3 条）
NormalForm1(1NF)： Each cell should have a single value, and we cannot have repeated columns.
一个单元格中不能包含多个值，如果出现这个情况/问题，可以把该属性单独建立表格。
NormalForm2(2NF): Each table should describe one entity and every column in that table should describe that entity.
NormalForm3(3NF): A column in the table should not be derived from other columns.

don't memorize the rules, but try to focus on avoiding the redundancy.

EAV:Entity--Attribute--Value

